This is Scotch 7.0.17 (libscotch only, without PT-Scotch), from
https://gitlab.inria.fr/scotch/scotch (tag v7.0.17).

Changes for Neper:

- Only the files needed to build libscotch, libscotcherr and
  libscotcherrexit are kept (as listed by Scotch's own build system).

- CMakeLists.txt is specific to Neper.  The library is built with the same
  options as Scotch's own build system with THREADS=ON (multithreading) and
  SCOTCH_DETERMINISTIC=FULL.  scotch.h is generated at build time by
  dummysizes, as in Scotch's own build system.

- The lexer and parser files (src/libscotch/parser_ll.c, parser_lh.h,
  parser_yy.c and parser_ly.h) have been generated from parser_ll.l and
  parser_yy.y with flex 2.6.4 and bison 3.8.2, so that flex and bison are
  not needed to build Neper.
